  "description": "Well-Located Fully Furnished Bungalow Available to Rent from Mid-October\n\nFully furnished bungalow in an excellent location, just a 2-minute drive from Rathcormac village centre and local school, within easy reach of Fermoy, and approximately 20 minutes from the Jack Lynch Tunnel.\n\nThe property comprises:\n\n* 2 spacious double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes\n* 1 large twin bedroom with built-in wardrobes\n* 1 single bedroom, currently used as a home office, also with a built-in wardrobe\n* Large, bright sitting room with stove fireplace\n* Separate dining room\n* Fully equipped kitchen with large American-style fridge freezer\n* Main bathroom with both bath and shower\n* Attached garage with space for 1 car\n* Large, mature landscaped garden\n* Private driveway with parking for up to 3 cars\n\nThe property is fully furnished throughout to a high standard and offers generous living space in a convenient and peaceful location.\n\n**References are required.**\n\nExpressions of interest are strictly by email only.\n",
